---

<footer class="bg-game-bg border-t border-game-border pt-14 pb-10">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-10 mb-12">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-game-accent font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">Juego</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-400">
          <li><a href="#historia" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Historia</a></li>
          <li><a href="#jugabilidad" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Jugabilidad</a></li>
          <li><a href="#galeria" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Galeria</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-game-accent font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">Comunidad</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-400">
          <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Discord</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Foros</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Novedades</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-game-accent font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">Soporte</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-400">
          <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Ayuda</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Contacto</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Privacidad</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-game-accent font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">Siguenos</h3>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <a href="#" aria-label="Twitter" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-game-accent transition">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path d="M23 3a10.9 10.9 0 01-3.14 1.53 4.48 4.48 0 00-7.86 3v1A10.66 10.66 0 013 4s-4 9 5 13a11.64 11.64 0 01-7 2c9 5 20 0 20-11.5a4.5 4.5 0 00-.08-.83A7.72 7.72 0 0023 3z"></path></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="#" aria-label="Instagram" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-game-accent transition">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="#" aria-label="Discord" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-game-accent transition">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0018 0zM9 10a1 1 0 001 1v4a1 1 0 001 1h2a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 00-1-1H9a1 1 0 00-1 1z"></path></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-game-border/40 pt-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[11px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest">
      <p>Creado por <span class="text-game-accent">ComredSystem</span>. <span id="year">{new Date().getFullYear()}</span></p>
      <p>Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
